--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
External dependencies (not bundled, installed separately):

- Bun (MIT) — https://bun.sh — runs the lifeos CLI and its built-in SQLite
- Omarchy shell / Quickshell (LGPL-3.0) and Qt 6 (LGPL-3.0) — host the plugin
- JetBrainsMono Nerd Font (OFL-1.1) — icons, provided by Omarchy
- Noto Color Emoji (OFL-1.1) — countdown emoji, provided by Omarchy
- Inter (OFL-1.1) — optional; used for text when installed
